    "revision": 1
   }
  ],
  "statement": "$\\ket{\\psi}$ is $\\nu$-compressible if it can be prepared by a unitary $U$ acting on $\\nu$ qubits followed by an $n$-qubit Clifford circuit. The paper states (attributing the equivalence to Gu et al.) that a state is $\\nu$-compressible if and only if it has stabilizer nullity $\\nu$."
 },
